{"t_ms": 2473609, "conversation_id": "conv_sentence_end_s2_034", "turn_id": 1, "actor": "system", "event_type": "retrieval_result", "payload": {"passages": ["Steam Room Guidelines\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nThe steam room is available daily from 7:00 AM to 9:00 PM. Guests should limit each session to 15\u201320 minutes for maximum comfort. Individuals with heart conditions, high blood pressure, or other medical concerns are advised to consult a healthcare professional before using the facility.", "Indoor Games Room\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nGuests can enjoy a variety of indoor recreational activities including table tennis, carrom, chess, billiards, and board games. The Games Room is open daily from 8:00 AM to 10:00 PM. Equipment should be returned after use, and guests are requested to maintain a quiet and respectful environment.", "Room Amenities Guide\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nEvery guest room is equipped with complimentary Wi-Fi, air conditioning, a smart television, electronic safe, telephone, minibar, tea and coffee-making facilities, bottled drinking water, premium toiletries, fresh towels, and a hairdryer. Additional amenities such as an iron, ironing board, or extra pillows can be requested through housekeeping."], "scores": [0.5765314102172852, 0.7434008121490479, 0.7618104219436646], "timing_policy": "sentence_end", "timing_trigger": "sentence_end", "user_end_known_at_finish": true, "launch_offset_ms_vs_user_end": 1406, "overlap_with_speech_ms": 0, "forecast_invalidated": false}}
